t("[leave]", "[Salir]", "_t")
t("@playername@! My daughter's savior!", "@playername@! ¡El salvador de mi hija!", "_t")
t("Hi, I was just checking in to see if Melinda is all right.", "Hola, estaba revisando para ver si Melinda estás bien.", "_t")
t("Hi, I would like to talk to Melinda please.", "Hola, me gustaría hablar con Melinda, por favor.", "_t")
t("Melinda", "Melinda", "_t")
t("Sorry, I have to go!", "¡Lo siento, tengo que irme!", "chat_last-hope-melinda-father")
t("Please take this. It is nothing compared to the life of my child. Oh, and she wanted to thank you in person; I will call her.", "Por favor, toma esto. No es nada comparado con la vida de mi hijo. Oh, y quería agradecerte en persona; la llamaré.", "_t")
t("Thank you.", "Gracias.", "_t")
t("Melinda's father gives you: %s", "El padre de Melinda te da:%s", "logPlayer")
t("#CRIMSON#Your timetravel has no effect on pre-determined outcomes such as this.", "#CRIMSON#Tu timetravel no tienes efecto en los resultados predeterminados como este.", "_t")
t("@playername@! #LIGHT_GREEN#*She jumps for joy and hugs you while her father returns to his shop.*#WHITE#", "@playername@! #LIGHT_GREEN# Ella salta de alegría y te abraza mientras tu padre regresa a tu tienda. ##", "_t")
t("I am glad to see you are fine. It seems your scars are healing quite well.", "Me alegra ver que estás bien. Parece que tus cicatrices están sanando bastante bien.", "_t")
t("I am glad to see you well. Take care.", "Me alegro de verte bien. Cuídate.", "_t")
t("Should I come across a way to help you during my travels, I will try to help.", "Si encuentro una manera de ayudarte durante mis viajes, intentaré ayudar.", "_t")
t("Thank you, you are most welcome.", "Gracias, eres bienvenido.", "_t")
t("Most certainly, so what are your plans now?", "Ciertamente, ¿cuáles son sus planes ahora?", "_t")
t("Hi @playername@! I am feeling better now, even starting to grow restless...", "¡Hola @playername@! Me siento mejor ahora, incluso empezando a crecer inquieto...", "_t")
t("So what are your plans now?", "¿Cuáles son sus planes ahora?", "_t")
t("About that, I was thinking that maybe you'd like to go out with me sometime ...", "Sobre eso, estaba pensando que tal vez te gustaría salir conmigo alguna vez...", "_t")
t("I am still looking out for an explanation of what happened at the beach.", "Todavía estoy buscando una explicación de lo que pasó en la playa.", "_t")
t("About what happened on the beach, I think I have found something.", "Sobre lo que pasó en la playa, creo que he encontrado algo.", "_t")
t("I have seen how you fought those corruptors, the way you destroyed their magic. I want to learn to do the same, so that such horrors never happen again. To anyone.", "He visto cómo luchaste contra esos corruptores, la forma en que destruyeste tu magia. Quiero aprender a hacer lo mismo, para que esos horrores nunca vuelvan a suceder. A cualquiera.", "_t")
t("Derth has its up and downs but I think they could do with a smart girl yes.", "Derth tienes sus altibajos pero creo que podrían hacer con una chica inteligente sí.", "_t")
t("Thanks!", "¡Gracias!", "_t")
t("You wish to join our noble crusade against magic? Wonderful! I will talk to them for you.", "¿Quieres unirte a nuestra noble cruzada contra la magia? Maravilloso! Hablaré con ellos por ti.", "_t")
t("That would be very nice!", "¡Eso sería muy bonito!", "_t")
t("I happen to be welcome among the people of Angolwen, I could say a word for you.", "Resulta que soy bienvenido entre la gente de Angolwen, podría decir una palabra para tú.", "_t")
t("What?!? Just because you rescued me from a moderately-to-extremely gruesome death, you think that entitles you to take liberties?!", "¿Qué? Sólo porque me rescató de una muerte moderadamente horrible, ¿crees que te da derecho a tomar libertades?!", "_t")
t("WHY AREN'T WOMEN ATTRACTED TO ME I'M A NICE %s.", "POR QUÉ LAS MUJERES NO ME ATRAGANTAN, SOY UNA BUENA AMIGA.%s", "tformat")
t("GIRL", "GIRL", "_t")
t("GUY", "GUY", "_t")
t("Uhh, sorry I hear my father calling, see you.", "Siento oír a mi padre llamando, verte.", "_t")
t("Just a minute, I was just...", "Un momento, estaba...", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#[walk away with her]#WHITE#What about a little trip to the south, from the coastline we can see the Charred Scar Volcano, it is a wonderous sight.", "#LIGHT_GREEN# [apártate con ella]#WHITE#Qué tal un pequeño viaje al sur, desde la costa podemos ver el volcán Charred Scar, eres una vista maravillosa.", "_t")
t("Joke's on you really, goodbye!", "¡Joke estás en ti, adiós!", "_t")
t("But... ok goodbye.", "Pero... adiós.", "_t")
t("I think I would enjoy that very much. #LIGHT_GREEN#[kiss her]#WHITE#", "Creo que disfrutaría mucho. #LIGHT GREEN # [besarla] #WHITE#", "_t")
t("That thought will carry me in the dark places I shall walk. #LIGHT_GREEN#[kiss her]#WHITE#", "Ese pensamiento me llevará en los lugares oscuros que caminaré. #LIGHT GREEN # [besarla] #WHITE#", "_t")
t("Oh, I am sorry. I think you are mistaken. I was only trying to comfort you.", "Lo siento. Creo que estás equivocado. Sólo intentaba consolarte.", "_t")
t("Oh, sorry, I was not myself. Goodbye, then. Farewell.", "Lo siento, no fui yo mismo. Adiós, entonces. Adiós.", "_t")
t("Yes, I think so. Some time ago I assumed ownership of a very special home... #LIGHT_GREEN#[tell her the Fortress story]#WHITE#", "Sí, eso creo. Hace algún tiempo asumí la propiedad de un hogar muy especial... #LIGHT_GREEN# [dígale la historia de la Fortaleza]#", "_t")
t("The Fortress seems to think so. I know this might sound a bit .. inappropriate .. but you would need to come live there, at least for a while.", "La Fortaleza parece pensarlo. Sé que esto podría sonar un poco inapropiado pero tendrías que venir a vivir allí, al menos por un tiempo.", "_t")
t("Then my lady, if you will follow me. #LIGHT_GREEN#[take her to the Fortress]", "Entonces mi señora, si me sigue. #LIGHT_GREEN# [Llévela a la Fortaleza]", "_t")

